{
  "id": "trench_excavation",
  "title": "Trench Excavation",
  "description": "Estimate trench excavation - online calculator.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Trench Excavation Calculator\n\nEstimate trench excavation volume and material weight using this calculator.\n\n![Trench excavation - slope and volume](static/docs/documents/1717/excavation_slope.png \"Trench excavation - slope and volume\")\n\n## Calculation Methods\n\n- **Imperial Units**: For trench volume calculations in feet and cubic yards\n- **SI Units**: For trench volume calculations in meters and cubic meters"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "trench_length",
          "label": "Trench Length",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 100,
          "unit": "ft"
        },
        {
          "id": "trench_depth",
          "label": "Trench Depth",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 4,
          "unit": "ft"
        },
        {
          "id": "trench_width_top",
          "label": "Trench Width (Top)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 3,
          "unit": "ft"
        },
        {
          "id": "trench_width_bottom",
          "label": "Trench Width (Bottom)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 2,
          "unit": "ft"
        },
        {
          "id": "fill_material",
          "label": "Fill Material Type",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": 1920,
              "label": "Clay, damp"
            },
            {
              "value": 2080,
              "label": "Clay, saturated"
            },
            {
              "value": 1840,
              "label": "Sand, damp"
            },
            {
              "value": 1600,
              "label": "Sand, dry"
            },
            {
              "value": 1920,
              "label": "Sand, wet"
            },
            {
              "value": 1600,
              "label": "Topsoil with sand, damp"
            },
            {
              "value": 1840,
              "label": "Topsoil, saturated"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": 1600,
          "unit": "kg/m³"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "volume_cubic_feet",
          "label": "Volume (Cubic Feet)",
          "formula": "((inputs.trench_width_top + inputs.trench_width_bottom) / 2) * inputs.trench_depth * inputs.trench_length",
          "unit": "ft³",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "volume_cubic_yards",
          "label": "Volume (Cubic Yards)",
          "formula": "(((inputs.trench_width_top + inputs.trench_width_bottom) / 2) * inputs.trench_depth * inputs.trench_length) / 27",
          "unit": "yd³",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "volume_cubic_meters",
          "label": "Volume (Cubic Meters)",
          "formula": "((inputs.trench_width_top + inputs.trench_width_bottom) / 2) * inputs.trench_depth * inputs.trench_length * 0.092903",
          "unit": "m³",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "fill_weight_kg",
          "label": "Fill Material Weight",
          "formula": "((inputs.trench_width_top + inputs.trench_width_bottom) / 2) * inputs.trench_depth * inputs.trench_length * 0.092903 * inputs.fill_material",
          "unit": "kg",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Fill Material",
        "Density (kg/m³)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Clay, damp",
          1920
        ],
        [
          "Clay, saturated",
          2080
        ],
        [
          "Sand, damp",
          1840
        ],
        [
          "Sand, dry",
          1600
        ],
        [
          "Sand, wet",
          1920
        ],
        [
          "Topsoil with sand, damp",
          1600
        ],
        [
          "Topsoil, saturated",
          1840
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}